## Safety rules

- Keep reports local unless their contents have been reviewed.
- Never write API tokens, passwords, serial paths, entity names, or raw
  terminal output to a public repository.
- Preserve Zigbee network identity, keys, pairing data, and backups.
- Validate changes before applying them to a live installation.
